    "text": "## Description\n\nBRP - Crop plots consists of the location of agricultural plots linked to the crop grown. The file is a subset of selection of information from the Basic Register of Plots (BRP) of the Netherlands Enterprise Agency. The boundaries of the agricultural plots are based on the Agricultural Area of \u200b\u200bthe Netherlands (AAN).\n\nThe user of the plot must annually register his crop plots and indicate which crop is grown on the plot in question. A dataset is generated for each year with reference date May 15.\n\n_The field boundaries are valid for the year 2022_\n\n- **Original Data Provider:** [PDOK Control](https://service.pdok.nl/rvo/brpgewaspercelen/atom/v1_0/basisregistratie_gewaspercelen_brp.xml)\n- **Converted by:** Kerner Lab (ASU)\n- **License:** CC0-1.0\n- **Projection:** EPSG:4326\n\n---\n\n## Columns\n\n| Property               | Data Type |\n| ---------------------- | --------- |\n| id                     | string    |\n| determination_datetime | datetime  |\n| crop_type              | string    |\n| crop_category          | string    |\n| status                 | string    |\n"
  },
